# Build context exclusions.
#
# Every image builds from the repo root, because each one needs common/ as well
# as its own directory. That makes the context the whole tree, so the things
# that must never reach an image are listed here.
#
# The first three blocks are about size and cache invalidation. The last one is
# not: researcher data and the local build plan must not be baked into an image
# any more than they may be committed -- see AGENTS.md.

.git/
.github/
.gitignore

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

*.md

tests/
evals/

data/
uploads/
*.h5ad
*.rds
BIOGENT_PLAN.md
